13\" href=\"/Hosea.10.13\">Ho 10:13</a> + (var. sfs. 11 times);—"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong> adj.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבּוֹר בַּבְּהֵמָה</span> <em>mightiest among beasts</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.30\">Pr 30:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ גִּבּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:52\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.52\">1 S 14:52</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבּוֹר בָּאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:2\" href=\"/Psalms.112.2\">ψ 112:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבּוֹר צַיִד</span> <em>mighty in hunting</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:9\" href=\"/Genesis.10.9\">Gn 10:9</a> (J); <span dir=\"rtl\">מלך גבור</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:3\" href=\"/Daniel.11.3\">Dn 11:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל גִּבּוֹר</span> the Messiah <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.5\">Is 9:5</a>; attribute of God especially as fighting for his people <a data-ref=\"Psalms 24:8\" href=\"/Psalms.24.8\">ψ 24:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.17\">Dt 10:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:32\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.32\">Ne 9:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.21\">Is 10:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.18\">Je 32:18</a> (cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">الجَبَّارُ</span>)."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong> n.m.</strong> <em>strong, valiant man</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:2\" href=\"/Joshua.10.2\">Jos 10:2</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:4\" href=\"/Genesis.6.4\">Gn 6:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:8\" href=\"/Genesis.10.8\">10:8</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:13\" href=\"/Judges.5.13\">Ju 5:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:23\" href=\"/Judges.5.23\">23</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.4\">1 S 2:4</a> + 16 times <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.8\">1 K 1:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.10\">10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.16\">2 K 24:16</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:10\" hr